ines, replacing fuses, solving puzzles and fighting off enemy robots. \n\nRemember, without your efforts Cityscape would simply stop functioning. Your services are appreciated!\n\nNote 4 users: We recommend Android 5.1.1 or greater for the best experience.", "short_description": "Cityscape is a massive infrastructure that requires constant maintenance in order to function properly. As the Repairman, it is your duty to ensure that all maintenance tasks are completed in a timely and efficient manner. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.khora-vr.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.khora-vr.com/", "publisher_name": "Khora ApS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.khoravr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "473528324488842"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12504572_1030717573685347_482790831_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZCn7-zLvpvcQ7kNvwHFzxJt&_nc_oc=AdoTPA5GBhmMt8q0D2XubVFnsgejn7801HHDZUxKj4NbwbazPNPNrcz5PmMzh-Yy5UY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS8iloE5nIMTD4-Vrgaq-S0ZEQRWBDsChSL_CJwegV3yQ&oe=6B0B1B38"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Cityscape Repairman", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "release_date": 1450339